WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Gustav Online can make useful knowledge public learning.
The ideas are already there.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Visual choices, production versions, lineage,
and approval still depend on one founder.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
onlinesourdough diagnoses Offer, Operations, and Demand.
Here, Demand is the constraint.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
AIOS routes bounded context, owner, next action, and evidence.
It does not merge the products.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
ADS sets direction. ACS holds lineage and review.
Diffusion renders locally. Each stays separate.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The goal is fewer repeated founder decisions—not hands-off automation.
Gustav keeps final approval.
